#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/faq.rst:54
msgid "Is CTHarvester suitable for medical diagnosis?"
msgstr "의료 진단에 사용해도 되나요?"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/faq.rst:56
msgid "**No.** CTHarvester is a research and preprocessing tool, **not** a medical device. It should not be used for clinical diagnosis, treatment planning, or any medical decision-making."
msgstr "**아니요.** CTHarvester는 연구·전처리 도구이며 의료 기기가 **아닙니다**. 임상 진단, 치료 계획, 그 밖의 의학적 의사결정에 사용해서는 안 됩니다."

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/CTHarvester/docs/manual/faq.rst:58
